    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Case of one exponential for the impact decay. For this reason, in what follows we assume (i) h to be nondecreasing and we restrict our attention to the exponential Volterra kernel, i.e.,"
  }, {
