    "content" : "G(t,s) = {t≥s}ae−b(t−s), t,s ∈ [0,T], a > 0, b ≥ 0, to study the monotonicity property of the operator V := II + IV. In this way, we conveniently use the relation ∂xG(t,s) = −bG(t,s), for 0 ≤ s < t ≤ T, and the fact that k ≡ a. Specifically, by Fubini’s Theorem and straightforward calculus, we get for any u, v ∈ L2"
