    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Concluding on the nonnegativity of the above quantity in general depends on the endogenous signal g as was the case for III. But if we additionally assume that (ii) g ≡ 0 and (iii) x  → xh′(x) is nondecreasing, then clearly V is monotone, which proves Proposition 2.8."
